; Run on the segments last first, two cards a segment in (pc, kind), six out: nxtpc (the next segment that isn't a
; pause), adjv (the segment after, if it is a vowel), nextv (the next vowel anywhere ahead, AX if none), ts and te
; (the segment's start and end filters) and nts (the start filter of the segment after; 0 for a pause). The filters
; come from the table: the host deals cards TS TE ASP of the row asked for (OUT at ask). HH's filter is the
; aspirated form of the vowel after it (AX's if no vowel comes next).
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   pc       03-17: a pause: what lies ahead, and no filters
  04                    INP   kind
  05                    CLA   kind
  06                    SUB   c8
  07                    TAC   sound
  08                    OUT   nxtpc
  09                    OUT   adjv
  10                    OUT   nextv
  11                    OUT   z
  12                    OUT   z
  13                    OUT   nts
  14                    CLA   z
  15                    STO   adjv
  16                    STO   nts
  17                    JMP   rec
  18            sound   CLA   pc       18-39: the row: the segment's own, or for HH the next vowel's (or AX's)
  19                    STO   q
  20                    CLA   kind
  21                    SUB   n7
  22                    TAC   ask
  23                    CLA   cax
  24                    STO   q
  25                    CLA   nxtv
  26                    SUB   00
  27                    TAC   ask
  28                    CLA   nxtpc
  29                    STO   q
  30            ask     OUT   q
  31            gts     INP   ts
  32            gte     INP   te
  33            gasp    INP   asp
  34                    CLA   kind
  35                    SUB   n7
  36                    TAC   emit
  37                    CLA   asp
  38                    STO   ts
  39                    STO   te
  40            emit    OUT   nxtpc    40-62: the cards, then this segment is the one ahead
  41                    OUT   adjv
  42                    OUT   nextv
  43                    OUT   ts
  44                    OUT   te
  45                    OUT   nts
  46                    CLA   pc
  47                    STO   nxtpc
  48                    CLA   ts
  49                    STO   nts
  50                    CLA   kind
  51                    SUB   n2
  52                    TAC   vw
  53                    CLA   z
  54                    STO   nxtv
  55                    STO   adjv
  56                    JMP   rec
  57            vw      CLA   00
  58                    STO   nxtv
  59                    CLA   pc
  60                    STO   adjv
  61                    STO   nextv
  62                    JMP   rec
  70            pc      DATA  0
  71            kind    DATA  0
  72            q       DATA  0
  73            ts      DATA  0
  74            te      DATA  0
  75            asp     DATA  0
  76            nxtpc   DATA  0
  77            nxtv    DATA  0
  78            adjv    DATA  0
  79            nextv   DATA  18       AX
  80            nts     DATA  0
  81            z       DATA  0
  82            c8      DATA  8
  83            n7      DATA  7
  84            n2      DATA  2
  85            cax     DATA  18
